---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { media } from '../data/media';
---
<section class="boarding section" id="life"><div class="wrap boarding-grid">
  <div class="boarding-images"><Image class="boarding-main" src={media.boarding.src} widths={[480, 760, 1000]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 55vw" alt={media.boarding.alt} loading="lazy" /><Image class="boarding-detail" src={media.boardingDetail.src} widths={[320, 520]} sizes="28vw" alt={media.boardingDetail.alt} loading="lazy" /><span class="sun-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
  <div><h2>A boarding school, with community at its centre.</h2><p>Amus College is a boarding school. Beyond lessons, school life is built through shared routines, friendships, reflection and the everyday support of a learning community.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions">Ask about life at Amus <span>→</span></a></div>
</div></section>
